      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": "1. NUMBER SYSTEM – BASIC CONCEPT"
    },
    {
      "type": "keyFacts",
      "title": "Key Takeaways",
      "items": [
        "The Number System forms the fundamental base for quantitative aptitude topics.",
        "Understanding specific number properties is essential for solving advanced numerical problems.",
        "Divisibility rules serve as time-saving shortcuts during competitive calculations.",
        "Factors and multiples are key to understanding number relations, HCF, and LCM."
      ],
      "id": "b2ep3f3"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "ki58euu",
      "content": "Number System deals with classification and properties of numbers used in calculations.<br></br><br></br>In SSC examination, questions from Number System are:<br></br>• Basic<br></br>• Concept-based<br></br>• Usually one or two steps only"
    },
    {
